"size":28633312,"digest":"sha256:13362f73ed81b5988ebc6d7e6ec63aeb4a197647c706121ab9f1cf45efee0b7c","download_count":1080,"created_at":"2026-10-04T21:15:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T21:15:54Z"},{"id":610745628,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4kZz0c","name":"DBX_0.6.34_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":182405488,"digest":"sha256:b6d1610ae05c951a9000a63d32668bcae68cdc134e37c2fae5a818d429e110c0","download_count":49,"created_at":"2026-10-04T21:45:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T21:45:06Z"},{"id":610745627,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4kZz0b","name":"DBX_0.6.34_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":118,"digest":"sha256:6ea54ae59dfbbf774399bd131a8690401636a89a6f7fefcb991b8159dbe653d5","download_count":23,"created_at":"2026-10-04T21:45:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T21:45:02Z"},{"id":610684465,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4kZk4x","name":"DBX_0.6.34_x64.dmg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":42080981,"digest":"sha256:f561514f382750d3edccb22dc28f54ee13a9a8514575b3a4384a067e820768bb","download_count":94,"created_at":"2026-10-04T21:12:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T21:12:13Z"},{"id":610691655,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4kZmpH","name":"DBX_0.6.34_x64_en-US.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":37289984,"digest":"sha256:81e0568a0a1333e0d169c3f3fb7c34ffefdd1298cfde8f9e7162c00f6a994a3f","download_count":88,"created_at":"2026-10-04T21:15:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T21:15:52Z"},{"id":610684531,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4kZk5z","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":42030245,"digest":"sha256:56e0bb5e8235f2de203aa3fc23a3482cee59f3dc080a6e868af5532af7d49352","download_count":56,"created_at":"2026-10-04T21:12:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T21:12:15Z"},{"id":610766104,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4kZ40Y","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":18157,"digest":"sha256:165f1b09ebf1237d7af621c095a694b81d35dc98eb3dcd13a92fcfc0fc2d7708","download_count":17609,"created_at":"2026-10-04T21:56:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T21:56:06Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n\n- 新增 Apache CouchDB 数据源支持，可创建连接、浏览数据库与文档数据并执行查询 (contributed by @saefulrahman) (PR [#11068](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11068))\n- 表右键菜单新增模型生成，可从表结构生成 TypeScript、Zod、Pydantic、Go、Rust、Java、C# 等 15 种语言与校验框架代码，支持语法高亮预览和自定义模板 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#11076](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11076))\n- 数据传输仅结构模式新增执行前 SQL 预览，可先确认目标库将要执行的结构语句再开始传输 (contributed by @0verme) (PR [#11066](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11066))\n- 插件工作台新增独立浮窗承载方式，可置顶常驻并停靠到屏幕边缘，适合播放器、快捷选择器等小组件 (contributed by @onceMisery) (PR [#11064](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11064))\n- 查询图表支持在柱状图和折线图上显示数据标签，直接读取每个数据点的数值 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11067](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11067))\n- SQL 编辑器新增行尾多光标，可一次在多行行尾同时输入 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#10880](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10880))\n- 工具栏新增立即同步入口，无需进入设置即可触发同步 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#10898](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10898))\n- CREATE TABLE 和 ALTER TABLE 中的列类型支持自动补全 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11073](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11073))\n- 侧边栏双击字段或索引直接打开表结构编辑器并定位到目标项，单击定位数据列的行为保持不变 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#11075](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11075))\n- 侧边栏对象树显示存储过程和函数的注释 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11063](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11063))\n- 对象浏览器为处于无效状态的存储过程、函数、视图显示失效标记和状态徽标 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11062](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11062))\n- Oracle 数据库链接移至侧边栏底部独立分组，并支持显示/隐藏切换 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11060](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11060))\n- 点击侧边栏列可在数据网格中快速定位该列 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11042](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11042))\n- 新增执行计划默认视图设置，可预设画布、树、摘要、表格或原始文本 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11049](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11049))\n- 函数补全支持配置参数示例 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11051](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11051))\n- 输入完整的 SQL 关键字时也提供大小写转换补全，where、order by、group 等全词输入可补全为关键字标准写法 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11048](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11048))\n- 保存到 SQL 库对话框新增新建文件夹按钮 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11025](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11025))\n- SQL 库文件夹新增排序选项 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11026](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11026))\n- SQL 库文件右键菜单新增新建查询入口 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11028](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11028))\n- 新增导出完成后自动打开所在文件夹的设置项 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11056](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11056))\n- 导出记住上次导出目录，并支持设置常用导出目录 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11029](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11029))\n- Web 模式品牌标识位置支持配置或隐藏 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11057](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11057))\n- 标签页最大宽度支持自定义 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11047](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11047))\n- 下拉选择框支持直接键入文字筛选和匹配选项 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11034](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11034))\n\n### 改进\n\n- 驱动包更新改为 zstd 增量下载，基于本地缓存的旧版本重建新包，驱动升级下载量从整包数十 MB 缩小到几 MB (PR [#11074](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11074))\n- 首页默认展示工作区概览，上一版本默认进入的介绍页不再强制，仍可在设置中切换\n- 补全印尼语翻译，覆盖数据字典、内置文档和 Meilisearch 管理界面 (contributed by @cunkz) (PR [#10920](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10920))\n- 数据表格布尔复选框样式改进，浅色和深色主题下显示更清晰 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11027](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11027))\n\n### 修复\n\n- 修复 JDBC 连接（如 IBM i AS/400）上存储过程和函数不显示参数结构并提示 Object source is not supported 的问题\n- 修复 Linux KDE 上应用启动时因 Secret Service 密钥项锁定而报错的问题，重试时自动解锁\n- 修复 MongoDB 经 SSH 隧道连接副本集时未遵循 directConnection 参数导致连接失败的问题 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#10916](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10916))\n- 修复 MongoDB 补全 new Date() 等构造函数时未替换已输入的 new 导致内容重复的问题 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#11036](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11036))\n- 修复 MongoDB 通过 db[\"name\"] 方式访问的集合无法补全的问题 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#11039](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11039))\n- 修复 MongoDB $elemMatch 补全未给出其可用查询操作符的问题 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#11035](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11035))\n- 修复 MongoDB 在非游标结果后输入点号仍弹出无关补全建议的问题 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#11038](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11038))\n- 修复 MongoDB 更新补全未提供 $comment、未跳过已使用的键、$set 值位置仍给出字段建议的问题 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#11040](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11040))\n- 修复 MongoDB 采样推断的日期和 ObjectId 字段在补全中未标注 BSON 类型的问题 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#11037](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11037))\n- 修复 DB2 补全未限定列名时未按登录 schema 解析的问题 (contributed by @Tong-bit-art) (PR [#11061](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11061))\n- 数据网格行定位支持唯一键并新增虚拟唯一键设置，无主键的表也能安全读取大字段完整值、更新和删除行，DB2 大字段延迟加载同步生效\n- 修复选择 SQL 文件后目标数据库被重置丢失的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11065](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11065))\n- 修复查询历史面板宽度异常，并将特殊页面与侧边栏布局隔离 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11055](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11055))\n- 修复 macOS 调整窗口大小时左上角红绿灯按钮跳动的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#11033](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11033))\n- 修复深色模式和 IDE 主题下背景图片不显示的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11030](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11030))\n- 修复导出 HTML 在 Excel 中打开时单元格内容被当作公式求值的问题 (contributed by @Tong-bit-art) (PR [#11031](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11031))\n- 修复未先点击数据网格时编辑表结构快捷键无效的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11032](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11032))\n\n### 安装\n\n- 修复 Nix 构建的 pnpm 依赖哈希不匹配问题\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.34) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.34` 拉取。\n","mentions_count":9}
